pairwise squared objective and `0.2` reference gauge. The flexible model is the
same fixed-seed two-layer ReLU random-feature family, with input width changing
only from 16 to 15; its ridge is still selected inside every outer fold from
`{0.01, 0.1, 1, 10, 100, 1000}` using training-only anchor validation.

