`DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM`. Read-only measurement on the workspace copy; no sealed artefact or setting was changed.

## Verified by running code

Measured **20 real anchors** from `V025_PROBE/world/3` in pilot evaluation order (step, then the three sealed reference carriers), with 4 final epoch-2000 FULL lineages: **80 matched anchor-seed decisions**. The selector inputs and catalogue are the pilot's deployed `_build_anchor_rows(..., full_legal_actions=True)` and `_catalogue_with_census` paths. Exact Ψ is from `_exact_interactions` on every legal row; learned Ψ is `model.interaction(context)` with the production `contexts.get(configuration_id)` gate. Every comparison removes only the interaction term from the same FULL model's scores and applies score-descending / lexicographic-configuration-ID argmax.

